ght":"900","letterSpacing":"normal","margin":"24px 0px 0px","padding":"0px","color":"rgb(38, 38, 38)","background":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"},{"tag":"A","cls":"site-button neuro-button","text":"Book Combo Package","x":39,"y":5456.09375,"w":243,"h":53,"font":"900 14px / 16.8px Lato, Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"900","letterSpacing":"normal","margin":"0px","padding":"11px 29px","color":"rgb(255, 255, 255)","background":"rgb(133, 92, 172)"},{"tag":"H2","cls":"","text":"I didn't find this in a book.\nI found it in the hardest\nyears of my life.","x":16,"y":5678.09375,"w":358,"h":201.5625,"font":"700 36px / 40.32px \"IBM Plex Sans\", Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"700","letterSpacing":"-1.26px","margin":"0px 0px 35px","padding":"0px","color":"rgb(248, 241, 238)","background":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"},{"tag":"P","cls":"","text":"I built a successful international career at the United Nations — working alongside diplomats, leading people across different cultures, and changing my career ","x":16,"y":5914.65625,"w":358,"h":100.78125,"font":"14px / 16.8px Lato, Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"normal","margin":"0px 0px 12px","padding":"0px","color":"rgb(248, 241, 238)","background":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"},{"tag":"P","cls":"","text":"And it was. I also had a husband I love, two children growing up too fast, and aging parents who needed me. Every role I played, I gave it everything. What I di","x":16,"y":6027.4375,"w":358,"h":100.78125,"font":"14px / 16.8px Lato, Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"normal","margin":"0px 0px 12px","padding":"0px","color":"rgb(248, 241, 238)","background":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"},{"tag":"P","cls":"","text":"That's when I stopped looking for a better strategy and started understanding how my brain actually works. That search led me to neuroscience — and changed ever","x":16,"y":6140.21875,"w":358,"h":50.390625,"font":"14px / 16.8px Lato, Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"normal","margin":"0px 0px 12px","padding":"0px","color":"rgb(248, 241, 238)","background":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"},{"tag":"H3","cls":"","text":"I was doing everything\nright. And I still felt\ncompletely lost.","x":16,"y":6238.609375,"w":358,"h":120.9375,"font":"700 36px / 40.32px \"IBM Plex Sans\", Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"700","letterSpacing":"-1.26px","margin":"48px 0px 25px","padding":"0px","color":"rgb(248, 241, 238)","background":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"},{"tag":"P","cls":"","text":"That's the moment I understand better than any theory. It's not about not trying hard enough. It's about running a system that was never designed for this much ","x":16,"y":6384.546875,"w":358,"h":67.1875,"font":"14px / 16.8px Lato, Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"normal","margin":"0px 0px 12px","padding":"0px","color":"rgb(248, 241, 238)","background":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"},{"tag":"H2","cls":"","text":"The method based on the NeuroIntegration method by Katerina Lengold","x":19,"y":7027.734375,"w":358,"h":150,"font":"700 31px / 50px \"IBM Plex Sans\", Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"700","letterSpacing":"-1.395px","margin":"0px 0px 61px 3px","padding":"0px","color":"rgb(38, 38, 38)","background":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"},{"tag":"P","cls":"","text":"The NeuroIntegration method was developed by Katerina Lengold, founder of the California Institute of Neurointegration.","x":16,"y":7238.734375,"w":358,"h":63,"font":"15px / 21px Lato, Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"normal","margin":"0px 0px 15px","padding":"0px","color":"rgb(92, 84, 103)","background":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"},{"tag":"P","cls":"","text":"It combines neuroscience, psychology, and behavioural science into a practical coaching framework that works with how your brain is actually wired. NeuroSprints","x":16,"y":7316.734375,"w":358,"h":126,"font":"15px / 21px Lato, Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"normal","margin":"0px 0px 15px","padding":"0px","color":"rgb(92, 84, 103)","background":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"},{"tag":"LI","cls":"","text":"ACT · NEUROSPRINT\nUse neuroscience-informed planning cycles to reach goals without burnout.","x":44,"y":7857.625,"w":330,"h":58,"font":"14px / 21.7px Lato, Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"normal","margin":"0px","padding":"0px 0px 0px 12px","color":"rgb(92, 84, 103)","background":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"},{"tag":"LI","cls":"","text":"THINK · NEUROSURFING\nRewire habitual thought patterns, reduce cognitive rigidity, and build creative thinking.","x":44,"y":7945.625,"w":330,"h":58,"font":"14px / 21.7px Lato, Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"normal","margin":"0px","padding":"0px 0px 0px 12px","color":"rgb(92, 84, 103)","background":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"},{"tag":"LI","cls":"","text":"FEEL · NEUROBALANCE\nTrain your nervous system to recover faster from stress and stay emotionally balanced.","x":44,"y":8033.625,"w":330,"h":58,"font":"14px / 21.7px Lato, Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"normal","margin":"0px","padding":"0px 0px 0px 12px","color":"rgb(92, 84, 103)","background":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"},{"tag":"H2","cls":"","text":"Is this you?\nYou might be in the right place if...","x":16,"y":8233.625,"w":358,"h":113.390625,"font":"700 36px / 37.8px \"IBM Plex Sans\", Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"700","letterSpacing":"-1.62px","margin":"0px 0px 35px","padding":"0px","color":"rgb(38, 38, 38)","background":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"},{"tag":"P","cls":"","text":"You're exhausted but can't slow down\nYou keep pushing through — but the energy just isn't there anymore.","x":16,"y":8382.015625,"w":358,"h":105,"font":"14px / 21.7px Lato, Arial, sans-serif","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"normal","margin":"0px","padding":"13px 15px","color":"rgb(92, 84, 103)","background":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"},{"tag":"P","cls":"","text":"You're facing a big change\nNew country, new role, new chapter — and you don't know where to start.","x":16,"y":8500.015625,"w":358,"h":123,"font":"14px / 21.7px Lato, Arial, sans-ser